Comment: 0,0:12:15.55,0:12:21.64,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Comment: 0,0:12:23.06,0:12:28.64,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.37,0:01:33.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mr. Ryu, standby okay!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.07,0:01:34.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Good!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.12,0:01:37.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro, standby for docking.\NReady?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.63,0:01:41.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going in, Mr. Ryu!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.29,0:01:43.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,5... 4...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.50,0:01:46.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,3... 2... 1...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.47,0:01:48.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Laser searcher synchronized.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.68,0:01:50.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,5... 4...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.43,0:01:53.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gundam B Parts released!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.53,0:01:58.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Core Change! Docking, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.41,0:02:19.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The young crew had survived thus far\Nby working together as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.02,0:02:20.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But selfishness and frustration...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.88,0:02:23.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...had created an uncomfortable tension\Namong the crew members.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.47,0:02:25.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.67,0:02:31.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...the enemy was bearing down on them\Nregardless of the youths' problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.92,0:02:52.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The decryption isn't wrong, is it...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.37,0:02:55.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. It says,\N"Stay put until Odessa Day."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.84,0:02:57.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I checked many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.45,0:03:00.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ramba Ral, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.63,0:03:01.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.67,0:03:03.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He'll get us at this rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.81,0:03:07.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know, but Marker and Oscar\Nneed to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.93,0:03:12.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right. Those two may be\Nthe hardest workers in the crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.11,0:03:14.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I join you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.89,0:03:16.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aren't you mending the kids' clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.81,0:03:17.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm all finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.80,0:03:19.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're such a busy bee.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.15,0:03:22.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you eating at all?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.03,0:03:24.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Close the door. I might escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.49,0:03:26.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't say things like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.80,0:03:30.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That Ramba Ral guy\Nwill definitely come after us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.38,0:03:34.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even without his Zakus and Gouf...\Nhe'll be all the more determined. For sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.50,0:03:35.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So let 'em come.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.29,0:03:38.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll pilot the Gundam then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.22,0:03:40.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And what would you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.93,0:03:43.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think I might leave the White Base.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.81,0:03:44.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.56,0:03:47.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Why shouldn't I?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.60,0:03:49.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No one feels comfortable with me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.48,0:03:51.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.15,0:03:57.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You put all your strength into that punch,\Ndidn't you, Mr. Ryu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.97,0:04:00.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There was a time when\NMs. Matilda said that you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.82,0:04:02.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...might be some kind of an Esper.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.78,0:04:06.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought it was a reasonable thing\Nto say about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.45,0:04:08.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's about time you stopped sulking!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.85,0:04:11.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Quoting Ms. Matilda?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.24,0:04:13.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Try lecturing me with your own words.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.52,0:04:16.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Fraw Bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.61,0:04:17.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.18,0:04:24.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Does he really think one angry man\Nis enough to change a person?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.54,0:04:26.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,May I come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.26,0:04:27.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.86,0:04:29.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.35,0:04:31.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's about Amuro, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.06,0:04:34.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...Mr. Bright, you have no intention\Nof taking him off the Gundam, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.21,0:04:36.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why do you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.19,0:04:38.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The reason you put him in the brig...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.03,0:04:40.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...is to make Amuro think about what he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.69,0:04:42.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In other words, you're still counting on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.89,0:04:44.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.26,0:04:47.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But Bright, you were the one\Nwho wanted to remove him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.60,0:04:48.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.06,0:04:53.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro could have taken the Gundam\Nand defected to Zeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.77,0:04:57.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I puzzled over why he didn't do that.\NAnd as a result, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.78,0:04:59.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have hopes for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.70,0:05:00.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.78,0:05:04.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro only came back because\Nhe was momentarily homesick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.28,0:05:07.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But, you know, he's almost\Nwhere we need him to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.33,0:05:08.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right, Ryu?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.79,0:05:10.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this about Amuro?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.50,0:05:13.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hmm...\NI think he'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.51,0:05:24.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Ral,\Na message from Admiral Dozle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.22,0:05:26.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was relayed by Captain M'Quve.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.72,0:05:28.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is good news, Hamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.85,0:05:32.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're sending us 3 ground type\NDom mobile suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.48,0:05:34.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doms?\NYou mean those heavy mobile suits?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.81,0:05:36.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hamon, we're moving out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.77,0:05:41.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We attack the Trojan Horse\Nas soon as we receive those Doms.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.07,0:05:44.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Under the command of Kycilia Zabi,\NCaptain M'Quve's unit...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.78,0:05:48.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...controls the world's largest\Nmineral resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.54,0:05:51.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is M'Quve's main base.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.72,0:06:05.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ramba Ral knows too much\Nabout my mining activities here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.60,0:06:09.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These mines will be useful when\NLady Kycilia rules Zeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.89,0:06:12.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even Lord Gihren\Ncannot realize the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.81,0:06:13.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.52,0:06:15.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know what to do next?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.56,0:06:18.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But... we're sabotaging a request\Nfrom the Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.23,0:06:22.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.\NRamba Ral won't see it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.90,0:06:23.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.57,0:06:26.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ryu! Wake up! Ryu!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.45,0:06:29.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ryu! Hayato and the others just left!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.24,0:06:31.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that, Ms. Sayla?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.91,0:06:36.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hayato, Kai, Howard, and Maximilian\Njust took off! Can you follow them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.63,0:06:38.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sure, I'll get right on it!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.68,0:06:50.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this!\NEveryone's acting so selfishly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.56,0:06:52.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Ryu!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.89,0:06:56.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me! I'll bring them back\Neven if I've gotta knock some sense into them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.85,0:06:59.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ryu! I want to go too! Take me with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.19,0:07:01.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll be back soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.78,0:07:09.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hayato is pretty forthright,\Nin his own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.95,0:07:13.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have we really been paying\Ntoo much attention to Amuro?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.79,0:07:16.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone's overlooking one crucial thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.33,0:07:17.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Overlooking what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.75,0:07:22.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When Amuro was away,\NI felt very uneasy as commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.80,0:07:24.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uneasy...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.09,0:07:27.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think you've brought us a lot of luck...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.01,0:07:29.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...but without Amuro...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.26,0:07:33.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...I felt an incredible uneasiness\Nthat I've never felt before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.39,0:07:35.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.03,0:07:53.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Point A13. There's no mistake?\N- No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.79,0:07:55.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,30 minutes have passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.50,0:07:56.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look, dear. A light!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.29,0:08:03.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That belongs to one of M'Quve's men.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.09,0:08:08.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Doms aren't coming?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.63,0:08:11.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. It is very unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.43,0:08:14.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,M'Quve's forces couldn't provide\Ncover in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.31,0:08:19.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The supply ship was destroyed just before\Nentering Central Asia. The Doms were...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.19,0:08:21.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell Lord M'Quve that I, Ramba Ral...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.31,0:08:25.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...will carry out my mission,\Neven if it's with my bare hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.74,0:08:26.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.82,0:08:27.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.74,0:08:28.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.78,0:08:32.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.03,0:08:34.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I guess that's what they mean\Nby "stubborn old war-horse".
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.83,0:08:36.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.41,0:08:38.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.46,0:08:40.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just as you predicted.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.12,0:08:43.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't rely on reinforcements, so we'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.05,0:08:50.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll use my old specialty, guerrilla tactics.\NWhat do you think, Clamp?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.34,0:08:54.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The men would love it, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.10,0:09:00.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, they finally stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.48,0:09:08.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you guys think you're doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.53,0:09:11.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't have to be\Non the White Base to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.32,0:09:13.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll find a local Federation unit and...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.57,0:09:15.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're going to abandon Bright?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.16,0:09:17.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bright has Amuro with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.75,0:09:19.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Enough, Kai!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.41,0:09:23.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've lost my reason to fight\Naboard the White Base.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.33,0:09:25.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's nothing anyone can do about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.38,0:09:27.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.84,0:09:31.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Gallop goes in front of the Trojan Horse\Nand acts as a decoy, with Ghien's Zaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.97,0:09:34.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then we come in from behind with the Cuis.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.97,0:09:37.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hamon will take command of the Gallop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.14,0:09:41.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Clamp and I will command\Nthe first and second Cuis.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.69,0:09:42.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.48,0:09:43.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.60,0:09:45.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right. Mobilize the Gallop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.73,0:09:49.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When we see the Trojan Horse, the Zaku\Nand Cuis will split off from the Gallop.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.00,0:10:05.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the Trojan Horse.\NIt's only moved 10 kilometers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.63,0:10:06.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.79,0:10:10.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Zaku! Cuis! Prepare to launch from\Nthe Gallop in 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.46,0:10:12.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, Hamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.26,0:10:14.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can escape once we're on\Nthe Trojan Horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.43,0:10:17.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You be careful too, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.52,0:10:24.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You didn't have to hit me, Ryu!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.02,0:10:25.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.31,0:10:28.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't force people to listen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.77,0:10:32.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You guys won't understand unless you're hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.15,0:10:33.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.24,0:10:33.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.83,0:10:41.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get down! We can't let them spot us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.72,0:10:59.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That sound...\NMust be the Gallop the prisoner mentioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.18,0:11:00.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's headed for the White Base.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.81,0:11:02.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ramba Ral's team.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.27,0:11:07.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll have to ask your own conscience\Nwhether you'll come back or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.73,0:11:08.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ryu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.52,0:11:09.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.45,0:11:17.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Zaku, Ghien, launch!\NFollowed by the Cuis!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.75,0:11:24.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Launch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.38,0:11:34.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.47,0:11:35.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.63,0:11:36.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.63,0:11:38.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.80,0:11:42.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It sure got chilly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.89,0:11:43.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Kai...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.77,0:11:46.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.17,0:12:13.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This wind, this sensation...\NThis is war!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.47,0:13:05.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.14,0:13:08.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you the pilot\Nof that white mobile suit, Gundam?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.64,0:13:12.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Such a nice boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.65,0:13:14.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's see how he fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.07,0:13:20.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sayla! How close are they?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.16,0:13:23.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't get an accurate estimate\Nat this station.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.45,0:13:25.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've called for Oscar and Marker.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.79,0:13:28.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prepare forward missiles!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.12,0:13:30.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mirai! Get the power up on the main engine!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.58,0:13:32.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. Engine start, complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.96,0:13:35.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,1 minute 20 seconds\Nuntil we can resume flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.21,0:13:37.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry we slept in!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.96,0:13:40.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Open beam cannons on both sides!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.05,0:13:43.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The rear missiles too.\NThere's more than one enemy machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.47,0:13:47.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger! Open beam cannons!\NAssessing the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.77,0:13:52.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something in front of us.\NPossibly the Gallop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.64,0:13:54.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't see anything else due to the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.15,0:13:57.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can the White Base ascend, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.36,0:13:59.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not yet! Open forward observation camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.86,0:14:03.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the Gallop! Entering firing range!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.57,0:14:04.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fire main cannons!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.08,0:14:15.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're here...!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.80,0:14:21.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Port-side guns!\NWhat are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.51,0:14:23.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a Zaku! Fire! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.55,0:14:26.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Bright, I'm launching in the Gundam.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.18,0:14:27.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Sayla...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.18,0:14:32.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a Zaku on the left. Get some altitude\Nso you won't be a sitting duck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.39,0:14:33.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.48,0:14:36.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll do my best. Gundam, launching!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.32,0:14:47.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw Bow, get Amuro out of the brig.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.99,0:14:51.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The door key is type 6E.\NDo you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.20,0:14:52.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.29,0:14:56.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, the White Base's buggies are driving\Nall the way over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.17,0:14:58.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They can't do anything over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.67,0:15:00.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? Have Ryu and the others come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.88,0:15:03.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Over there! You can see them, Mr. Bright!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.84,0:15:07.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mirai! Bring the forward deck level with\Nthe mountain ledge on the starboard side.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.68,0:15:08.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.14,0:15:11.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw Bow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.97,0:15:13.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.35,0:15:14.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Gundam?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.02,0:15:15.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Sayla took it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.39,0:15:17.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're manning the port-side machine guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.86,0:15:18.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.69,0:15:19.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.90,0:15:23.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? What the hell are those?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.20,0:15:27.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like tanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.87,0:15:29.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're right! Those are for commandos!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.78,0:15:32.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're planning to storm us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.20,0:15:34.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're jumping onto the White Base!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.41,0:15:36.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.13,0:15:44.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The buggies made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.59,0:15:45.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.76,0:15:47.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Two tanks from behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.51,0:15:48.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.84,0:15:50.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Commando tanks, called Cuis!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.64,0:15:53.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? Commandos?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.52,0:15:55.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I took so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.86,0:16:06.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Sayla! Get further back before you aim!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.49,0:16:07.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Jump backwards!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.95,0:16:08.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.87,0:16:14.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here he comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.83,0:16:19.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.50,0:16:24.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well done, Ms. Sayla!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.46,0:16:26.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Trojan Horse is going to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.42,0:16:28.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Begin firing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.80,0:16:33.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're being attacked from behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.06,0:16:36.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ryu! Kai! Anyone who can fight,\Ngo to the rear!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.73,0:16:38.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're going to halt the enemy's advance!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.90,0:16:42.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Marker! Oscar! Do you have sidearms?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.40,0:16:44.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.02,0:16:46.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unless they're trying to capture\Nthe White Base...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.40,0:16:48.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...the Gallop would be hitting us harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.45,0:16:51.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.58,0:17:01.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That man is coming...!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.17,0:17:05.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.93,0:17:17.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Charge in where there's not as much fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.35,0:17:23.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Clamp team, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.49,0:17:38.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't let them into the White Base!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.54,0:17:43.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's no good...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.04,0:17:47.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Gundam's weapons are too powerful...\Nthere's no way I can hit just the men.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.55,0:17:52.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You jerk! Go away! I hope you fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.76,0:17:54.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's a little kid doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.14,0:18:00.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get back! Or you'll get hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.64,0:18:02.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you to get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.11,0:18:10.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oscar and Marker! Take the bridge entrance!\NJob John! To the front!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.44,0:18:10.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.07,0:18:16.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right! We can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.63,0:18:29.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hatch 78 has been breached!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.30,0:18:31.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.52,0:18:44.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry! We're taking the sub-bridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.77,0:18:50.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you were armed, I'd kill you!\NGo hide somewhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.11,0:18:51.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's you...!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.94,0:18:54.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The man from the restaurant...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.37,0:19:08.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You won because of that mobile suit!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.04,0:19:10.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not because of your own strength!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.13,0:19:16.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why you...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.80,0:19:20.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Replace Sayla in the Gundam!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.14,0:19:23.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Use the Gundam to get the enemy\Nout of the second bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.18,0:19:24.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.48,0:19:26.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do it, even if the White Base takes damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.19,0:19:27.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.81,0:19:28.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Sayla!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.86,0:19:30.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.15,0:19:30.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,, Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.73,0:19:31.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's the enemy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.36,0:19:32.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The second bridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.23,0:19:32.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.07,0:19:36.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you think it's kind of strange...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.70,0:19:38.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...that they're all child soldiers?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.87,0:19:40.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, we're all short on personnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.74,0:19:42.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.54,0:19:45.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The enemy's here! The enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.62,0:19:47.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go straight!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.04,0:19:48.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, you won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.08,0:19:51.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cut the main bridge control circuits!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.67,0:19:53.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.68,0:20:00.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,P-Princess...!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.60,0:20:02.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it really you, Princess?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.02,0:20:08.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm certain of it. You must be Lady Artesia!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.48,0:20:10.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.56,0:20:13.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My father served under your father,\NSir Zeon Deikun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.94,0:20:16.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am Ramba Ral, son of Jimba Ral!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.87,0:20:25.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you know that I'm Artesia...\Nwhy do you point that gun at me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.00,0:20:28.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What...? Then... what are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.50,0:20:29.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sayla! Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.80,0:20:35.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ryu!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.96,0:20:37.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ramba Ral, please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.59,0:20:40.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.72,0:20:44.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro, can you hear me?!\NThey've taken the second bridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.72,0:20:45.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Destroy it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.97,0:20:47.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Roger!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.48,0:20:49.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C... Contact Hamon...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.31,0:20:51.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir! I have the frequency.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.61,0:20:55.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You men retreat. The mission's a failure!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.15,0:20:55.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dear... ?!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.19,0:20:58.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Hamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.07,0:21:00.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Destroy the Trojan Horse with the Gallop.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.66,0:21:04.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In the middle of a fight,\NRamba Ral forgot to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.08,0:21:06.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But Lady Artesia...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.58,0:21:08.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's happened?!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.46,0:21:17.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's that mobile suit, Gundam.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.55,0:21:23.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To think that my opponents\Nwere all less than half my age...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.09,0:21:24.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How ironic.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.94,0:21:34.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have fought splendidly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.44,0:21:37.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But now you'll see the fate of a soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.69,0:21:40.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want you to watch closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.00,0:21:53.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ral...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.05,0:22:06.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Hamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.51,0:22:08.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ramba Ral is dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.73,0:22:12.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.57,0:22:26.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eject the bridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.63,0:22:37.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still nothing from the lieutenant?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.84,0:22:39.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.17,0:22:40.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.76,0:22:42.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.97,0:22:49.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ramba Ral...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.40,0:22:59.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ramba Ral...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.19,0:23:00.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And Hamon...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.15,0:23:03.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.78,0:23:05.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Carry him carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.67,0:23:21.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hamon carries on the objective\Nof the fallen warrior, Ramba Ral.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.38,0:23:23.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}With so few weapons at her disposal...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.59,0:23:26.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...will Hamon be the one\Nto finally bring down Gundam?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.84,0:23:30.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In the midst of this crisis,\NRyu Jose's Core Fighter appears...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.10,0:23:31.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...to attack Hamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.14,0:23:36.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mobile Suit Gundam. Next episode...\NSorrow and Hatred.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.56,0:23:40.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will you be able to survive?
